# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AT Medical / DIG-cellexplorer — heavy, unreviewed upstream binary assets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The following large binary assets exist in the upstream project
# (cclank/cell-architecture-studio) but are intentionally NOT committed to this
# AT Medical repository during the Phase 0 initialization. Their licensing and
# provenance have not yet been reviewed (see docs/ASSET_REVIEW.md), and two of
# the GLB models are of unknown "user-provided" origin.
#
# To run the full-fidelity 3D prototype locally, restore them from upstream as
# described in docs/ASSET_REVIEW.md ("Restoring assets for local testing").
# Do NOT commit them here until the asset review in Phase 2 clears or replaces
# them.
# (directory contents ignored, but a tracked README placeholder is kept in each)
public/models/*
!public/models/README.md
public/cell-renders/*
!public/cell-renders/README.md
public/cell-renders-transparent/*
!public/cell-renders-transparent/README.md
public/texture-references/*
!public/texture-references/README.md
docs/media/*
!docs/media/README.md
